REGIONAL REGULATION OF BANGLI REGENCY

NUMBER 18 OF 2016

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF BANGLI,

Considering:

a. that with the enactment of Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection as amended by Law Number 35 of 2014 Concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2002 Concerning Child Protection and Law Number 24 of 2004 concerning Elimination of Domestic Violence, it is deemed necessary to prevent and overcome violence against Women and Children through legal protection for Women and Children victims of violence;
b. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, above it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence;

In View of:

1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 69 of 1958 concerning Establishment of Level II Regions Within Level I Regions of Bali, West Nusa Tenggara and East Nusa Tenggara (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1958 Number 122, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1655);
3. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
4. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235) as amended by Law Number 35 of 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 297, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5606);
5. Law Number 24 of 2004 concerning Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
6. Law Number 21 of 2007 concerning Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);
7. Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning Formulation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);
8. Law Number 16 of 2011 concerning Legal Aid (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 104, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5246);
9. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as amended several times, most recently by Law Number 9 of 2015 concerning Second Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);
10. Government Regulation Number 4 of 2006 concerning Implementation and Cooperation for Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2006 Number 15, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4604);
11. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 of 2008 concerning Implementation of Women's Protection;
12. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 3 of 2008 concerning Guidelines for Implementation of Child Protection;
13. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 1 of 2010 concerning Minimum Service Standards for Integrated Services for Women and Children Victims of Violence;
14. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 5 of 2010 concerning Guidelines for Establishment and Development of Integrated Service Centers;
15. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 02 of 2011 concerning Guidelines for Handling Child Victims of Violence;
16. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 19 of 2011 concerning Guidelines for Empowerment of Women Victims of Violence;
17. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 80 of 2015 concerning Formulation of Regional Legal Products (State News of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 2036);
18. Regional Regulation of Bali Province Number 3 of 2003 concerning Amendment to Regional Regulation of Bali Province Number 3 of 2001 concerning Desa Pakraman (Regional Gazette of Bali Province of 2003 Number 11, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of Bali Province Number 3);
19. Regional Regulation of Bangli Regency Number 11 of 2016 concerning Governmental Affairs (Regional Gazette of Bangli Regency of 2016 Number 11, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of Bangli Regency Number 9);

With Mutual Approval

